    "pillar_1_allergen": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>The Allergen Reality</h3><p>Food allergies are not a lifestyle choice. Across the UK, over <strong>2 million people</strong> live with a confirmed, clinically diagnosed food allergy<sup>[1]</sup>.</p><p>Yet in retail aisles and foodservice kitchens, allergen-safe alternatives are treated as an afterthought: loaded with synthetic binders, lacking authentic culinary depth, or confined to a tiny 'free-from' quarantine shelf.</p><p>Every Naked Sauce Co. recipe is developed <strong>naturally free from all 14 major allergens</strong> from day one. No nuts, gluten, dairy, eggs, soy, sesame, mustard, celery, or sulphites. One recipe that everyone can enjoy together.</p><p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; opacity: 0.75; margin-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(35,31,26,0.2); padding-top: 10px;\"><em><strong>Source [1]:</strong> Food Standards Agency (FSA), UK Food Allergy Prevalence Report (2020, 2024).</em></p>",
            "margin_top": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_block"
      ],
