    "pillar_2_upf": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>The Ultra-Processed Trap</h3><p>When standard brands strip out allergens, they routinely substitute them with ultra-processed fillers: modified starches, maltodextrins, xanthan gum, synthetic emulsifiers, and chemical stabilisers.</p><p>Today, approximately <strong>51% of the average UK adult diet</strong> is composed of ultra-processed foods (UPF)<sup>[2]</sup>, even though over <strong>81% of shoppers</strong> are actively looking to cut down on UPF ingredients<sup>[3]</sup>.</p><p>We say no to the industrial shortcuts. Our sauces are built purely from whole ingredients: vine-ripened tomatoes, raw cider vinegar, honey, fermented chillies, garlic, and fresh spices. 100% real food with zero compromises.</p><p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; opacity: 0.75; margin-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(35,31,26,0.2); padding-top: 10px;\"><em><strong>Sources:</strong> <sup>[2]</sup> Scientific Advisory Committee on Nutrition (SACN), Statement on Processed Foods and Health (2023); <sup>[3]</sup> Retail Consumer Dietary Review (2026).</em></p>",
            "margin_top": 2
          }
        }
      },
