        "heading": "<p>Purpose-Built. Nut-Free. Glass-Free. BRC Grade AA.</p>",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "subheading": "<p>True allergen safety cannot rely on shared lines. Every bottle, tub, and sachet is produced at our <strong>purpose-built, dedicated nut-free and glass-free facility</strong> certified to <strong>BRCGS Grade AA</strong> standards.</p><p>With 100 tonnes of wet sauce capacity weekly, scrape-surface steam-jacketed blenders, and strict swab validations, we provide commercial foodservice operations and retail stockists uncompromising consistency and peace of mind.</p>",
